<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Remove</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>remove &lt;item&gt;
remove all
</pre>
<p>This command makes you stop using a thing you wear, wield or hold, and puts it 
back in your inventory. <a cmd='#'>remove all</a> takes off everything at once, for example 
before a teacher trains you.
</p><p>A cursed item can't be removed: "The ring is cursed, you can't remove it!" The 
spell remove curse can help (see <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Curse</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Equipment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wear</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Wield</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Curse</a>
</pre>




</div>